WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.702
421 days ago,

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.770
Putin thought

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.471
he could overthrow

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.072
the Ukrainian government,

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.108
thought he could fracture nato

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:08.775
as he launched

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.010
an unprovoked war of aggression

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.344
with hundreds of thousands

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:12.812
of Russian forces

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.814
crossing the border and multiple

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:17.250
avenues of approach. He was wrong.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.820
Ukraine's spirit remains unbroken.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.757
There are now 31 members of Naito

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.226
and Naito is even stronger

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:26.993
and united

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:29.095
in the face of Russia's aggression

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.865
and its attack on the rules based order.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:32.665
The United States

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:33.767
and the members of this Contact

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.535
Group remain committed

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.569
to supporting Ukraine

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:37.470
as a fight for freedom

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.839
against Russia's illegal

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.108
and unprovoked invasion.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:42.575
To date,

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:43.643
the United States has committed

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.578
more than $35 billion

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:46.846
in military assistance,

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:48.948
including over 2 million tank

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.684
and artillery rounds, tens of thousands

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:52.852
of anti-armor

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:53.620
weapons systems,

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.888
air defense systems

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.523
and other forms of munitions,

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:57.390
hundreds of tanks

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.725
and armored vehicles

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.093
precision aerial munitions and

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:02.228
counter U.S. capabilities.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.731
In addition,

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:05.298
there's about

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:06.933
2500 Ukrainian soldiers

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:08.802
conducting training right now.

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:10.136
In Germany.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.506
Another 8800, almost 9000,

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.208
have completed training

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.377
and have returned to Ukraine,

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.912
and there are 65 Ukrainians

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.447
that completed training on Patriot

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:22.982
missile systems just recently

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:25.385
since the early phases of this war.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.653
And for every month since,

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:29.022
the United States has provided Ukraine

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:31.624
with the capabilities to defend itself

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:32.292
and in conjunction

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:33.893
with our allies and partners,

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.462
we have delivered.

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:36.963
This coalition will continue

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.765
to provide vital training

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.133
and additional capabilities

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.835
for air defense and maneuver

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:44.504
to enable Ukraine's ongoing fight,

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.740
air defense, munitions

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.944
air defense capabilities, tank munitions,

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:51.978
armored vehicle

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.013
capabilities, artillery, ammunition,

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:56.583
artillery tubes and rockets

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.818
and spare parts remain critical

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.020
as Ukraine protects its cities and expels

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.123
the Russian menace from its territory.

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:05.358
Our countries and the

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.059
countries of Europe

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:06.526
have pledged

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:07.894
that Ukraine will have the capabilities

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:09.796
it needs to execute their missions

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.464
on their own timeline.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:12.765
And we have pledged that support

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:13.700
for as long as it takes,

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.635
as the Secretary just said.

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:16.202
This week,

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.337
the United States announced

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:19.372
our latest security assistance package

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:21.007
as part of our ongoing commitment

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.342
to Ukraine.

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:23.776
As we stand here today.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:24.677
The Ukrainian military

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.913
continues to perform very well

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.114
intense fighting in and around.

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:29.549
Baku continues

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.751
and has for several months.

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:34.053
Russia is expanding significant manpower

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:37.023
for very little gain

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:38.625
Russia is intensifying

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:39.726
indiscriminate shelling

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:41.895
and vigor in other cities

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:43.396
and urban areas.

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:44.097
And Russia

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:45.832
continues to pay severely

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:48.001
for its war of choice.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.335
Unlike Ukrainian forces

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:50.403
who are highly motivated

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:51.938
to fight for their country,

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:53.473
to fight for their freedom,

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:55.875
their democracy and their way of life,

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:58.111
The Russian lack and leadership

00:02:58.478 --> 00:02:59.779
they lack will.

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:01.281
The morale is poor

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:02.582
and their discipline is eroding.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.951
Russia has resorted

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:06.553
to tightening conscription laws

00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:07.320
as they

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.656
indiscriminately feed their citizens

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:11.524
into the chaos of war.

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:12.625
And so far,

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:13.726
they've been quite ineffective

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:14.994
in the coordination

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:16.229
or direction of combined arms

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:18.198
maneuver on the battlefield.

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:19.532
Over the past year, Russia's

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.467
temporary territorial gains

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:23.937
have come with enormous losses.

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:25.872
Hundreds of thousands of Russians

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:27.140
have fled their country.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.075
In addition to the casualties,

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:31.144
they are trying to avoid fighting

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:33.012
in Putin's war.

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:34.013
Russia continues

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:35.348
to fail in achieving its

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:37.250
strategic objectives.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.352
They failed to seize Kiev.

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:40.220
They failed to topple

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.821
the Ukrainian government.

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.190
And they failed to fracture NATO's

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.359
In fact, they've done just the opposite

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:49.028
Kiev stance.

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:51.431
The people of Ukraine are emboldened

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:54.300
and NATO's has never been stronger

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.635
As President Biden and Secretary

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:57.637
Austin have repeatedly said,

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:59.672
the United States remains committed

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:01.341
for as long as it takes.

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:01.741
Thank you.

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.142
And I look forward to your questions.

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:07.080
My question is going to both fighter

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:07.614
jets.

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:10.650
Ukraine said that they need more fighter

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.253
jets. Poland has just delivered mix.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.222
Did you talk about fighter jets

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:17.323
and how helpful

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:20.193
could they be for Ukraine?

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:21.894
Right now

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:23.863
with what we all believe

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:25.331
is what Ukraine needs

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:27.066
most urgently is ground

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:29.669
based air defense capability.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:32.739
That is what has enabled them to prevent

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:34.107
the Russian air forces

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.041
from having a meaningful,

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:37.744
meaningful impact in this fight.

00:04:37.744 --> 00:04:40.380
And so you've heard us say that

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.782
for the last several months.

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.851
We will continue to say that because

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:48.688
that is what is is most important

00:04:48.888 --> 00:04:50.223
in the current

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:53.426
in the future fight the immediate future.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:56.796
We have to make sure that the Ukrainians

00:04:56.796 --> 00:04:58.865
have the ability to

00:04:58.865 --> 00:05:00.300
protect their infrastructure,

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.934
protect their citizens,

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:03.336
but also protect troops

00:05:03.336 --> 00:05:05.071
that the troops are maneuvering.

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:08.941
So we we continue to engage our partners

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:12.512
and in allies and emphasize that

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:15.048
we need to do everything we can

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:17.650
to ensure that Ukraine has adequate

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:18.818
air defense, ground

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:20.820
based air defense capability.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.622
And I have to applaud

00:05:23.923 --> 00:05:26.859
the work that our partners are doing

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:27.694
where possible.

00:05:27.694 --> 00:05:29.562
They're stepping up to the plate.

00:05:29.562 --> 00:05:32.165
I believe that that we can still do more.

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:33.766
And I'm asking them to do more.

00:05:33.766 --> 00:05:36.302
And I believe that they will respond.

00:05:36.302 --> 00:05:38.371
First of all, those are policy questions.

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:40.006
They'll be made by political leaders.

00:05:40.006 --> 00:05:43.142
But from a military perspective, the task

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.713
is to control the airspace.

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:47.613
How you control

00:05:47.613 --> 00:05:48.715
that airspace can be done

00:05:48.715 --> 00:05:50.283
in many, many different ways,

00:05:50.283 --> 00:05:52.318
the most cost effective, efficient

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:54.554
and way to do that right now for Ukraine.

00:05:55.254 --> 00:05:56.522
And the fastest way to do that for

00:05:56.522 --> 00:05:57.657
Ukraine is through air defense.

00:05:57.657 --> 00:05:58.725
They've been doing it for

00:05:58.725 --> 00:05:59.826
over a year now.

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:01.661
They've been denying the airspace

00:06:01.661 --> 00:06:03.429
to effective Russian use.

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:04.330
The Russians have been flying

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:04.931
some sorties

00:06:04.931 --> 00:06:06.065
into Ukraine,

00:06:06.065 --> 00:06:07.633
but limited amounts of sorties over

00:06:07.633 --> 00:06:09.135
Russian occupied Ukraine.

00:06:09.135 --> 00:06:10.503
The Russians have not done

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:11.637
battlefield air interdiction

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:12.872
deep into Ukraine territory

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:14.607
except through missiles and rockets

00:06:14.607 --> 00:06:15.541
that have been fired from over

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:16.843
Russian territory.

00:06:16.843 --> 00:06:18.444
Why is that done? By the Russians?

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:19.645
Because the Ukraine is shooting

00:06:19.645 --> 00:06:20.880
Russian aircraft down.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.282
So the Russians are cautious

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:24.150
to come into Ukraine

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.084
because of the effective

00:06:25.084 --> 00:06:27.053
use of the Ukrainian air defense system.

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:28.688
That is the most critical thing right now

00:06:28.688 --> 00:06:30.156
is that air defense system

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:31.324
to make sure that it is

00:06:31.324 --> 00:06:33.192
robust, it's rigorous, it's deep,

00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:35.128
and it's layered from high altitude, mid

00:06:35.128 --> 00:06:36.462
altitude to low altitude

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:37.497
and from short range, mid

00:06:37.497 --> 00:06:38.965
range to long range.

00:06:38.965 --> 00:06:39.632
And the frontline

00:06:39.632 --> 00:06:40.967
forces, the Ukrainian frontline

00:06:40.967 --> 00:06:42.435
forces need to be protected.

00:06:42.435 --> 00:06:43.503
That's the most important

00:06:43.503 --> 00:06:45.037
critical military task right now.

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:47.273
That was the theme of this entire day.

00:06:47.273 --> 00:06:47.640
Was air

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.008
defense, air defense, air defense

00:06:49.008 --> 00:06:50.343
to make sure that

00:06:50.343 --> 00:06:52.678
Ukraine can defend its airspace

00:06:52.678 --> 00:06:54.847
in terms of the aircraft themselves.

00:06:54.847 --> 00:06:56.549
There's a long lead time for

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.285
for training of pilots, etc.

00:06:59.285 --> 00:06:59.886
And the Russians

00:06:59.886 --> 00:07:02.188
have a significant amount of air power

00:07:02.188 --> 00:07:03.823
and to take the Ukrainian air force

00:07:03.823 --> 00:07:04.891
from where it is today

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:06.659
and to build it up to match the Russian

00:07:06.659 --> 00:07:07.260
Air Force,

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.795
that's a significant level of effort

00:07:08.795 --> 00:07:10.263
by lots of countries.

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:11.431
And those policy choices

00:07:11.431 --> 00:07:13.833
may or may not be made down the road.

00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:14.934
And we'll see where that goes.

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:15.468
But right now,

00:07:15.468 --> 00:07:17.270
the immediate need is Air Defense

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:18.538
Secretary Austin,

00:07:18.538 --> 00:07:19.705
our contact group members

00:07:19.705 --> 00:07:20.573
working to speed up

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:22.175
deliveries of military supplies,

00:07:22.175 --> 00:07:23.075
especially key items

00:07:23.075 --> 00:07:24.510
such as artillery rounds

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.012
ahead of Ukraine's counteroffensive.

00:07:26.012 --> 00:07:27.480
And does Ukraine have the items

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.348
it needs for that offensive?

00:07:29.348 --> 00:07:31.150
And Chairman Milley,

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.418
do you think the Abrams tanks

00:07:32.418 --> 00:07:33.653
will have a significant impact

00:07:33.653 --> 00:07:34.821
once they arrive on the battlefield

00:07:34.821 --> 00:07:36.055
in Ukraine?

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:36.389
The U.S.

00:07:36.389 --> 00:07:37.790
has previously expressed concerns

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:38.424
about logistics

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:39.625
and sustainment for the tanks.

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:40.426
Have those concerns

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:42.094
been sufficiently addressed? Thank you.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:45.598
So several

00:07:45.598 --> 00:07:48.468
months ago, as we we set out to plan,

00:07:48.801 --> 00:07:49.502
as our people

00:07:49.502 --> 00:07:52.305
set out the plan with Ukrainian partners,

00:07:53.372 --> 00:07:55.541
we outlined the parameters for

00:07:56.108 --> 00:07:58.377
potential operations and we designed

00:07:59.679 --> 00:08:02.048
the support that would be required

00:08:02.048 --> 00:08:04.650
to to support those operations.

00:08:05.451 --> 00:08:07.820
And we laid that out in detail.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.056
And we that that set us on a path

00:08:10.056 --> 00:08:11.290
to generate combat

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.726
power, combat capability.

00:08:13.726 --> 00:08:15.428
You've heard us talk about the

00:08:15.428 --> 00:08:16.696
the combat platforms,

00:08:16.696 --> 00:08:18.865
the tanks, the Bradleys,

00:08:18.865 --> 00:08:21.300
the Stryker, the striker's, Martyr's CB.

00:08:21.334 --> 00:08:22.502
Ninety's

00:08:22.802 --> 00:08:23.703
in all of this,

00:08:23.703 --> 00:08:26.005
the sustainment that goes along with that

00:08:26.672 --> 00:08:29.075
in all of the munitions required

00:08:29.075 --> 00:08:31.310
to to be successful.

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:32.612
As you just heard

00:08:32.612 --> 00:08:35.147
both what the chairman and I said

00:08:35.147 --> 00:08:39.051
this was this was really difficult work

00:08:39.819 --> 00:08:42.188
but we have met our initial goals

00:08:42.455 --> 00:08:43.789
to provide

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:46.092
what's required to to get started.

00:08:46.392 --> 00:08:47.593
And we will.

00:08:47.593 --> 00:08:48.327
And we know

00:08:48.327 --> 00:08:50.997
that combat is dynamic complex.

00:08:51.731 --> 00:08:52.932
And so we understand

00:08:52.932 --> 00:08:54.000
that we're going to have to continue

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.269
to sustain Ukraine's efforts

00:08:56.269 --> 00:08:57.003
going forward.

00:08:58.004 --> 00:08:58.337
When the

00:08:58.337 --> 00:08:59.238
fight starts and

00:08:59.238 --> 00:09:02.241
long after the fight continues.

00:09:02.308 --> 00:09:04.277
So on the M1 tank,

00:09:04.277 --> 00:09:04.944
you know,

00:09:05.011 --> 00:09:05.678
I'm biased,

00:09:05.678 --> 00:09:06.979
but I think the M1 tanks, the best

00:09:06.979 --> 00:09:08.281
tank in the world,

00:09:08.314 --> 00:09:09.081
there are all the tanks

00:09:09.081 --> 00:09:10.182
that are quite good leopards,

00:09:10.182 --> 00:09:11.484
for example, being provided as well.

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:14.020
But I do think the M1 tank when it is

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.422
delivered, will make a difference.

00:09:16.422 --> 00:09:18.758
Now, let me distinguish between

00:09:18.758 --> 00:09:19.425
in a couple of weeks,

00:09:19.425 --> 00:09:20.526
you're got to get training tanks.

00:09:20.526 --> 00:09:21.928
Those aren't quite combat capable

00:09:21.928 --> 00:09:23.829
and they'll be used to train the crews

00:09:23.829 --> 00:09:24.897
on how to shoot,

00:09:24.897 --> 00:09:26.365
maneuver and maintain these tanks.

00:09:26.365 --> 00:09:26.899
And that'll be part

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:28.534
of the sustainment package

00:09:28.534 --> 00:09:29.502
to get them trained up

00:09:29.502 --> 00:09:30.303
as the other tanks

00:09:30.303 --> 00:09:32.338
are being refurbished in order

00:09:32.605 --> 00:09:34.373
to accelerate their delivery.

00:09:34.373 --> 00:09:35.441
But when they do get here

00:09:35.441 --> 00:09:37.176
and those crews are trained

00:09:37.176 --> 00:09:40.079
and they're using a combined arm maneuver

00:09:41.247 --> 00:09:42.315
tactic

00:09:42.481 --> 00:09:43.950
in combination with mech infantry,

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:46.218
the Bradleys, they'll be very effective.

00:09:46.218 --> 00:09:47.253
But I would also caution

00:09:47.253 --> 00:09:48.521
there's no silver bullet in war.

00:09:48.521 --> 00:09:50.189
It's a it's a war.

00:09:50.189 --> 00:09:51.524
The outcomes of battles and wars

00:09:51.524 --> 00:09:53.593
are the function of many, many variables

00:09:53.593 --> 00:09:54.860
And in this case,

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.062
you would have to make sure

00:09:56.062 --> 00:09:57.363
that your tanks are used

00:09:57.363 --> 00:09:59.165
in combined arms with mechanized

00:09:59.165 --> 00:10:00.833
infantry, artillery.

00:10:00.833 --> 00:10:01.834
All of that is synchronized

00:10:01.834 --> 00:10:04.403
with dismounted forces, etc.

00:10:04.403 --> 00:10:05.938
So there is no silver bullet

00:10:05.938 --> 00:10:06.706
in this case.

00:10:06.706 --> 00:10:07.440
But I do think

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.141
the M1 tank one is delivered

00:10:09.141 --> 00:10:10.977
and it reaches its operational capability

00:10:10.977 --> 00:10:11.978
that it will be very effective

00:10:11.978 --> 00:10:12.578
on the battlefield

